Ident 3:0
Manufacturer ETC
Console Eos
$$Format 3.20
! A small Eos show written for the qlcconsole course (Lesson 3.10), in the
! USITT ASCII form an Eos desk exports. It is not from a real production.
$$Title Classroom Eos sample
Clear All
Set Channels 100

! Conventional patch: one dimmer per channel.
$Patch 1 0 1 0 1
   Text FOH Left
$Patch 2 0 2 0 1
   Text FOH Center
$Patch 3 0 3 0 1
   Text FOH Right
$Patch 4 0 4 0 1
   Text Back Light
$Patch 5 0 5 0 1
   Text Cyc Blue
$Patch 6 0 6 0 1
   Text Specials
$Patch 11 0 11 0 1
   Text House Lights
$Patch 12 0 12 0 1
   Text Work Lights
$Patch 13 0 13 0 1
   Text Relay Stage Power
$Patch 14 0 14 0 1
   Text Backstage Blue

$Group 1
   Text Front
   1 Thru 3

$CueList 1
   Text Main
Cue 1 1
   Text Preshow
   Up 3
   Down 3
   Chan  11@FL 5@50
Cue 2 1
   Text House to half
   Up 5
   Down 5
   Chan  11@50 5@50
Cue 3 1
   Text House out
   Up 3
   Down 3
   Chan  11@0 5@0
Cue 4 1
   Text Opening
   Up 2
   Down 2
   Chan  1@FL 2@FL 3@FL 4@75 5@FL

Sub 1
   Text Work
   Up 2
   Down 2
   Chan 12@FL
EndData
